# Rule 10(b)(i): proceed in Copenhagen.TSS.Northbound.4 in its general direction of traffic flow (Northbound; simulator heading 270, 0 = east, y south) within 45 degrees; Rule 10(c): or cross it at right angles (within 15 degrees)
